# Model weights (>100MB rule, and they come from the professor's repo)
*.pt
*.onnx
*.pth
# Exception: the yolov8 weight from prof's repo (6 MB, safely under the 100 MB rule).
# Committed so the registration script picks up real weights on a fresh clone
# without requiring network access to the prof's repo at bootstrap time.
!models/yolov8n/best.pt

